	<h1><a href="/Academics-and-Services/Alumni-Foundation/Mih-Family-Fine-Arts-Center-Capital-Campaign"><img alt="Thumbnail" src="/portals/0/SP25%20Banner_1.jpg" title="Thumbnail" /></a></h1>

<h1>Support the Mih Family Fine Arts Center&nbsp;Capital Campaign!&nbsp;</h1>

<p>In partnership with the Mih Family, the NCCC Foundation has launched a capital campaign to renovate the existing auditorium on the Chanute Campus and transform the space into a modern fine arts center. Click the image to learn more about the project and make a donation today!</p>

